Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.BBvV7qoXGdw09q1C","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"NFhHJGtdxdC7P6tz"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Deep Dream Membrane","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[type:will|dc:20]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2} and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Drained]{Drained 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 4}, @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Drained]{Drained 2} and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Slowed]{Slowed 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Unconscious]{Unconscious} (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 5</strong> the creature dies, and its soul becomes trapped within a pebble in the bannog thief's possession.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"deep-dream-membrane","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["death","incapacitation","occult","poison"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"Kjw920PyV4SwH0Xw","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687135294096,"modifiedTime":1687135489513,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Imaginary Flurry","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The bannog thief makes three fist Strikes (applying its multiple attack penalty normally), then Steps.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"RF95wFG1wHC9exRl","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687135341301,"modifiedTime":1687135367471,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Lucid Step","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The bannog thief insidiously shifts itself into the dream of an adjacent @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Unconscious]{Unconscious} creature or into an unoccupied space on the Material Plane adjacent to the creature whose dream it inhabits. The bannog thief can stay on either plane indefinitely without ill effect.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"ARrF5rYeB7g9yvzG","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687135341635,"modifiedTime":1687135396127,"lastModifi